## Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/baghelrashmi04/cigar-10-classifier-webimage.git
cd cigar-10-classifier-webimage
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Make sure `index.html` is inside a `mltemplate/` folder (Flask's `template_folder` is set to
`mltemplate`), then run:

```bash
python appml.py
```

By default it serves at `http://localhost:5001`. To try a different model variant without
touching the code:

```bash
MODEL_PATH=cnn_quantized_float16.tflite python appml.py
```

